cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite the version you used."
title: "caniembody: a sourced robot-policy compatibility matrix"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "caniembody contributors"
version: "1.0.0-seed"
date-released: "2026-10-24"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://caniembody.pages.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/danilo-znamerovszkij/caniembody"
abstract: >
  A cell-level, evidence-linked compatibility reference for robot learning: which policies run on which
  robots, on which compute, at what measured inference rate. Every non-unknown cell carries typed evidence
  with a verification tier, date and exact software versions. v1 covers LeRobot-centric robot learning.
keywords: [robot learning, LeRobot, vision-language-action, imitation learning, compatibility, embodied AI]
